export anchor PiggyPlayfulStyle:
    number: 369
    screen: FinanceBudget
    name: Piggy playful
    idea: A friendly rounded money app on deep plum, with a big pink piggy bank that fills like a jar for the savings goal, budgets as little glass jars with faces that fill up, and cheerful words that stay kind when a jar overflows.
    base: dark
    palette:
        plumNight: #1c1630, the page and the style sheet
        card: #28203f, cards and pockets
        cardTwo: #352b52, chips, feed rows, empty glass and the secondary button
        line: #4a3f6e, field borders, jar lids and payee discs
        ink: #fbf4ff, text and the jar and piggy outlines
        muted: #c4b8dd, labels, dates and the jar glass outline
        pink: #ff9fcb, the piggy fill, the brand disc and the primary button
        onPink: #3a0c24, text on pink
        mint: #8ff0c8, jars with room to spare, money in and free money
        sun: #ffd66e, Full up jars, coins and the focus ring
        oops: #ff9b8a, the overflowing jar and the owed card balance
    type:
        A rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Varela Round, Arial
        Rounded MT Bold, Segoe UI, system-ui. Base 16px at 1.5. The greeting is
        34px at 800, the goal figure 36px at 800, card titles 21px at 800, body
        16px at 700 and tags 13px at 800.
    layout:
        A 1160px page. The top row has a round pink disc with a tiny piggy, the
        name and pill nav on the right, My month ringed in pink. Nice going,
        Mara! leads with a line saying four jars are fine and one got a little
        too full. A wide left column holds Your pockets, three cards with one
        tucked corner for Everyday, Savings and Credit card in coral with a
        clock and Pay by 12 Nov, then the October jars card with five drawn
        glass jars in a row, each filled to its share in mint, sun or coral,
        with eyes and a mouth. Under each jar sit the name, spent of limit and a
        pill tag. Eating out overflows with drips and a frown. A pill below says
        60 is still free. A 380px right column holds the Japan trip piggy, a
        large outlined pig filled pink to 64 percent with coins inside and 64%
        on the fill, then 3,200 of 5,000, Only 1,800 more to go and a Fly day 1
        April 2027 chip, then What happened lately as rounded rows with plus or
        minus discs, the salary disc in mint. Below 1000px the columns stack.
        Below 640px pockets stack and jars go three across.
    spacing:
        An 8px unit. 24px gutters and card padding, 14px between pockets, 12px
        between jars.
    density: Low. Three pockets, five jars, one piggy and five feed rows.
    corners:
        Very round. 32px cards, pockets with one 8px tucked corner, 22px rows,
        pill tags and buttons.
    borders: None on cards. Thick 3 to 5px light outlines on the jar and piggy drawings.
    shadows: Only a soft 4px ledge under buttons.
    icons:
        Drawn jars with faces, a smile for room to spare, a flat mouth for Full
        up and a frown with overflow drips for over. Tags repeat it with a
        circle check, ruled square or triangle beside the word.
    focus: A 3px sunny yellow outline offset 4px with round corners.
    tone:
        Warm and playful, such as Nice going, Mara!, 64 to spare, Full up, Oops,
        62 over and money in, yay.
